4	UI Card Redesign	✅ Completed	Golden badges (#1–#6), real Instagram CDN thumbnails, real reel links aur Reach/Likes/Comments metrics display kiye.','1	Live Post Metrics Auto-Sync	✅ Completed	server.ts me 15-minute background loop banaya jo Meta API se live likes, comments aur reach DB me auto-update karta hai.\r\n2	Zero-Login Client Review Portal	✅ Completed	Naya public portal PublicReviewView.tsx (/review/:token) banaya; client bina password ke post dekh kar 1-click Approve ya Request Changes kar sakta hai.\r\n3	Compose UI Action Bar Fix	✅ Completed	Squeezed buttons ko clean 3-row layout me convert kiya: Schedule (Gold), Publish/Draft (50%/50%), aur Get Review Link (Full Width).\r\n4	Brevo Email Automation	✅ Completed	Review link create hote hi Brand contact (bishtgaurav222@gmail.com) ko post thumbnail aur review button ke sath auto-email dispatch integrate aur test kiya.\r\n5	Security & Weak-Points Audit	✅ Completed	Version mismatch protection (post edit hone par purana link revoke), rate-limiting, aur fail-safe try-catch test pass kiye.\r\n6	Deployment	✅ Pushed	Saare builds pass (exit code 0) aur commits GitHub origin/main par live push ho chuke hain.','',NULL,6.47,'','','submitted','good',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-11-13 16:55:58','2026-11-13 16:55:58'),(257,8,'2026-11-13','','Edited the Vibesoft video this morning.\r\nRefined the footage into a polished final cut.\r\nShot a Snapchat-filter video for Vibesoft.\r\nCreated short-form content for Snapchat.\r\nHandled both video editing and filming.\r\nCompleted two video deliverables for the brand.','',NULL,6.99,'','','submitted','good',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-11-13 17:00:13','2026-11-13 17:00:13'),(258,6,'2026-11-14','ICA GMB','Ica gmb\r\nWhat today news\r\nCrm','',NULL,6.64,'','','submitted','good',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-11-14 16:55:21','2026-11-14 16:55:21'),(259,1,'2026-11-14','Lighting','Lighting','',NULL,5.92,'','','submitted','good',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-11-14 17:21:25','2026-11-14 17:21:25'),(260,8,'2026-11-14','','1. Created a Gemini AI-generated video for the client.\r\n2. Designed and developed a CTS poster for the client.\r\n3. Focused on maintaining professional visual quality and presentation.\r\n4. Completed the assigned creative tasks within the day.\r\n5. Finalized the deliverables for client review.','',NULL,7.70,'','','submitted','good',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-11-14 17:46:48','2026-11-14 17:46:48'),(261,12,'2026-11-16','📋 A1 Cleaning — Executive Work Report\r\n1. 🏗️ Architecture & Full-Width UI Overhaul\r\nDesktop Proportions: Website container ko narrow se expand karke 1400px full-width (92% viewport) kar diya gaya hai (1535px screen par fully spacious & responsive).\r\nExact Color Palette:\r\nPrimary Deep Green: #0B2922\r\nSoft Mint: #EAF3EE\r\nSage Green: #527A55\r\nBody Text: #58645F | Clean Canvas: #FFFFFF\r\nPixel-Accurate Theme Alignment:\r\nHeader: Clean logo left, centered nav (Home dark green pill), phone pill (+91 79063 66271) & Book a Service → button.\r\nHero Section: 44%/56% split with a 750×440px high-res cleaner visual.\r\n9 Core Services Grid: 3 equal columns, 2.5x sharp images, mint SVG icon boxes (#EAF3EE), multi-line titles without text clipping.\r\nMore Solutions (3 Pills): Floor & Surface Care, Additional Specialist, Property & Workplace.\r\nWhy Choose Us: Lifestyle living room photo + 3 value pillars with vertical dividers.\r\nBooking CTA Banner: Full-width deep green (#0B2922) banner with white pill button.\r\nCities Section: 3 balanced cards for Kashipur, Jaspur, and Ramnagar.\r\nFooter: 4-column minimal white layout with NAP and copyright.\r\n2. 📱 REST API Suite (For Website & Mobile App)\r\n\r\nMobile app (Flutter / React Native) ke liye 7 production REST APIs with CORS and standard JSON:\r\n\r\nGET /api/config — Master business NAP, hours, GPS coordinates, social links.\r\nGET /api/services — 9 services list with pricing, process, checklists, FAQs.\r\nGET /api/cities — 3 cities coverage & key areas.\r\nGET /api/pricing — Transparent rate cards.\r\nGET /api/reviews — Verified customer feedback.\r\nPOST /api/book — 10-digit phone validated lead/booking insertion.\r\nPOST /api/contact — General customer inquiries.\r\nAPI Keys Configured:\r\nAPP_API_KEY_PUBLIC: a1_clean_pub_917906366271\r\nAPP_API_KEY_SECRET: a1_clean_sec_8f93b2a7d4e1c5098142766\r\nDocumentation: Complete API manual at backend/api/README.md.\r\n3. 🔍 Hyper-Local SEO & AI Search (AEO/GEO)\r\nTopical Cluster Architecture (50+ URLs):\r\nHomepage (/)\r\n9 Service Hubs (/services/{service}/)\r\n3 City Hubs (/kashipur/, /jaspur/, /ramnagar/)\r\n27 City × Service Landing Pages: /{city}/{service}/ (Kashipur industrial dust vs Ramnagar Corbett humidity vs Jaspur hard water).\r\nFunnel & Support: /about/, /contact/, /pricing/, /gallery/, /reviews/, /book-now/, /book-now/thank-you/.\r\nJSON-LD Schema: Dynamic @graph combining WebSite, ProfessionalService (60km GeoCircle), Service, BreadcrumbList, and FAQPage.\r\nCrawling & Indexing: Strict robots.txt allowing AI bots (GPTBot, PerplexityBot, ClaudeBot), sitemap_index.xml + 3 child sitemaps, and thank-you page noindex.\r\n4. 🗄️ Backend, Security & Database\r\nDatabase Schema: backend/database/schema.sql with bookings and inquiries tables.\r\nFail-Safe DB Connection: PDO MySQL with graceful offline fallback.\r\nSecurity: Honeypot anti-spam, Indian phone regex validation (/^[6-9]\\d{9}$/), and CSRF protection.','📋 A1 Cleaning — Executive Work Report\r\n1. 🏗️ Architecture & Full-Width UI Overhaul\r\nDesktop Proportions: Website container ko narrow se expand karke 1400px full-width (92% viewport) kar diya gaya hai (1535px screen par fully spacious & responsive).\r\nExact Color Palette:\r\nPrimary Deep Green: #0B2922\r\nSoft Mint: #EAF3EE\r\nSage Green: #527A55\r\nBody Text: #58645F | Clean Canvas: #FFFFFF\r\nPixel-Accurate Theme Alignment:\r\nHeader: Clean logo left, centered nav (Home dark green pill), phone pill (+91 79063 66271) & Book a Service → button.\r\nHero Section: 44%/56% s