\nAdded complete Admin CMS control for managing services, media, before/after transformation galleries, and locations.\r\nFixed the Guest Booking Submission flow so unauthenticated users can complete checkout smoothly without database/session errors.\r\n5:00 PM','',5.85,'','','submitted','2026-10-09 17:01:48',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-09 17:01:48','2026-10-09 17:01:48'),(164,6,'2026-10-09','Products add','Producys added in lighting website','',6.84,'','','submitted','2026-10-09 17:05:41',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-09 17:05:41','2026-10-09 17:05:41'),(165,5,'2026-10-09','Blog post , product addition','Blog post , product addition','',6.85,'','','submitted','2026-10-09 17:06:22',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-09 17:06:22','2026-10-09 17:06:22'),(166,1,'2026-10-09','Jjm','Jjm','',7.54,'','','submitted','2026-10-09 17:15:03',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-09 17:15:03','2026-10-09 17:15:03'),(167,8,'2026-10-09','','Made ai bags','',7.30,'','','submitted','2026-10-09 17:30:03',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-09 17:30:03','2026-10-09 17:30:03'),(168,6,'2026-10-10','Products add','Products added in lighting website\r\nWhat today news post','',4.02,'','','submitted','2026-10-10 14:14:18',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-10 14:14:18','2026-10-10 14:14:18'),(169,12,'2026-10-10','UI & Layout Polish:\r\nFixed overlapping hero search bar and made header mobile/desktop responsive.\r\nRestructured /book & /cart form cards with crisp white backgrounds and warm orange glow borders.\r\nUpdated mobile home services to a neat 3×3 grid with clean typography.\r\nAdded auto-moving horizontal stats ticker and hidden bottom nav on desktop/large screens.\r\nService Search:\r\nAdded live service search & auto-suggestion filter in service category sidebars across devices.','Interactive Fixes:\r\nResolved the non-clickable FAQ accordion issue across all pages (eliminated duplicate listener conflicts).\r\nAccess Control & Auth Flow:\r\nAdded login guard for particular service detail pages (guests redirect to login/signup and seamle